{"id":1305,"date":"2026-08-22T14:57:46","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T14:57:46","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1305"},"modified":"2026-08-22T15:15:28","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T15:15:28","slug":"publication-templates","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/marketing\/publication-templates\/","title":{"rendered":"Publication Templates"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Publication Templates<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1308\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.jpg\" alt=\"Using a Template\" width=\"459\" height=\"401\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.jpg 1014w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates-300x262.jpg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates-768x670.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 459px) 100vw, 459px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Publication Templates library provides full-page, professionally designed starting points for common publication types &#8211; newsletters, flyers, brochures, menus, and more. Templates open as complete documents, ready for your content.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Using a Template<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To open a publication template:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; New<\/strong>, or click <strong>New<\/strong> in the File ribbon tab.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Browse the template gallery.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Double-click a template to open it.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Smart Template Behaviour<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1310\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SmartTemplates.webp\" alt=\"Smart Template Behaviour\" width=\"101\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SmartTemplates.webp 381w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SmartTemplates-253x300.webp 253w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 101px) 100vw, 101px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">If you open a template while on a new blank page, Open Publisher adds the template layout to your current page rather than replacing the whole document. This lets you mix and match layouts within a single publication.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><em>Note: Loading a template replaces the content of your currently selected page only &#8211; not the entire document.<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Publication Templates The Publication Templates library provides full-page, professionally designed starting points for common publication types &#8211; newsletters, flyers, brochures, menus, and more. Templates open as complete documents, ready for your content. Using a Template To open a publication template: Go to File &gt; New, or click New in the File ribbon tab. Browse the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1316,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[19],"class_list":["post-1305","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-marketing"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1305","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"htt